                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains the underlying experimental data supporting a high-throughput bioanalytical workflow for identifying muscarinic acetylcholine M1 receptor-binding toxins in crude snake venoms. It includes the raw and processed GraphPad Prism data underlying the radioligand binding experiments and figures reported in the associated manuscript. The dataset corresponds to the figures and analyses presented in the associated manuscript."
